# Claude Code: the owner's global ~/.gitignore keeps CLAUDE.md and .claude/ out of every repo. Here the rules
# and the review gate are shared; personal settings (which register the gate) and worktrees stay local.
!CLAUDE.md
!.claude/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

.superpowers/
node_modules/
out/
test-results/
playwright-report/
